---
import ThemeInit from "../components/ThemeInit.astro";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
import SiteVersion from "../components/SiteVersion.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import PageWatermark from "../components/PageWatermark.astro";
import { getImage } from "astro:assets";
import copyrightPhoto from "../assets/copyright-canal.jpeg";

const wallpaper = await getImage({
  src: copyrightPhoto,
  width: 2400,
  format: "webp",
  quality: 82,
});
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Copyright notice and privacy statement for Suraj Dash’s academic website." />
    <SiteVersion />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,650;0,700;1,400&amp;family=STIX+Two+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&amp;display=swap" />
    <link rel="preload" as="image" href={wallpaper.src} />
    <ThemeInit />
    <title>Copyright and privacy | Suraj Dash</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <PageWatermark src={wallpaper.src} />
    <main class="page-shell">
      <SiteNav current="/copyright" />
      <article class="notice-card">
        <h1>Copyright and privacy</h1>
        <p class="notice-updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-22">November 22, 2026</time>.</p>

        <section aria-labelledby="copyright-heading">
          <h2 id="copyright-heading">Copyright notice</h2>
          <p>© 2026 Suraj Dash. All rights reserved.</p>
          <p>The mathematical material on this website draws on the work of many authors. When using it, please acknowledge the appropriate original sources and contributors. These notes and expositions should not be treated as the original source of results established elsewhere.</p>
          <p>My personal photographs are shared for viewing on this website. Please do not copy, redistribute, or reuse them without my permission.</p>
          <p>For questions about attribution, requests to use personal photographs, or concerns about material on this website, contact <span class="email-address">suraj dot dash at utexas dot edu</span>.</p>
          <h3>Sources and third-party material</h3>
          <p>Material by other authors, including quotations, excerpts, translations, and linked publications, remains subject to its own rights and permissions. Joint work is subject to the rights of its coauthors and any applicable publication agreements. Links to papers, notes, or books do not grant rights to reproduce them. Fonts, software, and other components retain their respective licences.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
          <h2 id="privacy-heading">Privacy statement</h2>
          <h3>Browsing this website</h3>
          <p>I have not added analytics, advertising trackers, visitor accounts, or contact forms to this website. The website’s own code does not set cookies or use automated profiling.</p>
          <h3>Hosting</h3>
          <p>This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub records visitors’ IP addresses for security purposes, including when visitors are not signed in. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages#data-collection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub’s explanation of Pages data collection</a> and its <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Statement</a>.</p>
          <h3>Theme preference</h3>
          <p>The website saves your light or dark theme preference in your browser’s local storage so that it can be remembered on later visits. This setting is not sent to me. You can remove it by clearing this website’s stored data in your browser.</p>
          <h3>Fonts and external links</h3>
          <p>The DM Sans and STIX Two Text fonts load from Google Fonts. Your browser contacts Google to retrieve them, transmitting your IP address and information about the request. See the <a href="https://fonts.google.com/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Fonts FAQ</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
          <p>Some links open other websites or documents hosted on services such as Google Drive. Those services have their own privacy practices.</p>
          <h3>Correspondence and requests</h3>
          <p>If you email me, I receive your email address and whatever information you include. Correspondence may remain in my email account for replies and relevant academic or administrative records.</p>
          <p>For questions about this statement, or requests concerning personal information you have sent me, contact <span class="email-address">suraj dot dash at utexas dot edu</span>. Requests for access, correction, or deletion will be considered in light of applicable requirements and any recordkeeping obligations.</p>
          <h3>Changes</h3>
          <p>This statement and its update date will be revised if the website’s privacy practices change.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="acknowledgements-section" aria-labelledby="acknowledgements-heading">
          <h2 id="acknowledgements-heading">Acknowledgements</h2>
          <p>I am grateful to Natalia for helping me set up the initial version of this website. Its design draws on a wide range of online resources that have shaped my aesthetic sensibilities. I also acknowledge the assistance of GPT-6, made available through UT Austin, in the later stages of the website’s development.</p>
        </section>
      </article>
      <p class="background-caption">Watermark: Treviso, Italy · May 2026</p>
      <SiteFooter />
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(:root) {
    --bg: #eef2f5;
    --surface: #fafcfd;
    --text: #293c47;
    --heading: #284959;
    --muted: #647783;
    --link: #28657e;
    --line: rgba(41, 73, 88, .46);
    --card-edge: #547684;
    --shadow: rgba(36, 49, 58, .08);
    --background-overlay-start: rgba(223, 234, 240, .58);
    --background-overlay-end: rgba(223, 234, 240, .68);
    --card-bg: rgba(248, 251, 252, .95);
  }
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(body) {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 19.8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  :global(a) { color: var(--link); text-underline-offset: .18em; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
  .page-shell { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 48px)); min-height: 100vh; margin: 0 auto; padding-top: 32px; }
  .notice-card { position: relative; width: min(100%, 980px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px) 38px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(31, 57, 69, .15); }
  .notice-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    bottom: 18px;
    left: 0;
    width: 3px;
    border-radius: 0 999px 999px 0;
    background: var(--card-edge);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .notice-card {
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, .24);
  }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .notice-card::before {
    box-shadow: 1px 0 8px var(--card-edge);
  }
  h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--heading); font-family: "STIX Two Text", Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; }
  .notice-updated { margin: 10px 0 30px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--heading); font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; }
  h3 { margin: 25px 0 8px; color: var(--heading); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; }
  section p { margin: 0 0 15px; color: var(--text); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; }
  section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .privacy-section, .acknowledgements-section { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .email-address { white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--link); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .background-caption {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 32px;
    font-size: 0.77rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--caption);
    text-align: right;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px var(--caption-shadow);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .page-shell { width: calc(100% - 32px); padding-top: 24px; }
    .notice-card { padding: 24px 20px 28px; }
    h2 { font-size: 21px; }
    section p { font-size: 16px; }
  }
</style>
